{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Scooch 是一款專注回答「放得下嗎」的平面圖應用，適合準備搬家、添置傢俱或重新佈置家居的人。你可以按真實尺寸繪畫房間，再把傢俱以實際大小放入圖中，在搬動任何重物之前先看清哪些位置放得下、哪些會互相碰撞。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>按實際尺寸預覽傢俱擺位</h2>\n<p>應用內建 36 件簡潔傢俱，拖長餐桌會增加座位，加寬梳化會增添坐墊，放大衣櫃則長出更多櫃門，亦可自訂門與抽屜數目。椅可推入桌下，重疊的傢俱會以紅色標示，門與抽屜可顯示開啟所需空間。另支援多個平面圖與 26 款主題，並可匯出 PNG 或 PDF 及自動備份。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-417-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-418-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-419-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-420-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-421-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-422-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Scooch – Room &amp; Floor Planner</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T00:18:16.405577+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}